{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30305","headline":"昔昔盐二十首 蟠龙随镜隐 · 赵嘏","name":"昔昔盐二十首 蟠龙随镜隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸾镜无由照，蛾眉岂忍看。\n不知愁发换，空见隐龙蟠。\n那惬红颜改，偏伤白日残。\n今朝窥玉匣，双泪落阑干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}